### 5) 破坏 (scripts/drill-corrupt.sql)
  注入 WalletTransaction 注水行 (DRILL_INJECTED_BAD, +999999)          -> WalletTransaction 1->2
  注入 CreditLedger 注水行 (DRILL_INJECTED_BAD, +888888)              -> CreditLedger 1->2
  DELETE FROM PluginRelease                                          -> PluginRelease 1->0
  DELETE FROM Wallet                                                -> Wallet 1->0

### 6) 恢复 (pg_restore)
  pg_restore -Fc --clean --if-exists --no-owner -d <URL> <dump>      -> 退出码 0
  恢复后 counts 全部回到已知良好基线; 注水行已清除

### 7) 反向断言校验 (scripts/drill-verify.sh)
  GREEN 用例 (恢复后): 所有表 = 期望行数, 注水流水=0  -> 退出码 0 (绿)
